{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29837","headline":"和人题真娘墓 · 李商隐","name":"和人题真娘墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎丘山下劒池边，长遣游人叹逝川。\n罥树断丝悲舞席，出云清梵想歌筵。\n柳眉空吐效颦叶，榆荚还飞买笑钱。\n一自香魂招不得，祗应江上独婵娟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}